Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0
Recommends: policykit-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/CHAKCAAD/AETHONE
Description: Cross-platform VPN client (MASQUE, WireGuard, VLESS-WS, Tor, Psiphon)
 AETHONE routes the whole device or proxy-aware apps through Aether
 (WARP-class core) and zeptun (userspace TUN router) with MASQUE,
 WireGuard, VLESS-WS, Tor and Psiphon protocols.
 .
 While the tunnel is up the system proxy points at the same local SOCKS5
 listener (GNOME gsettings + KDE kioslaverc), so browsers ride the tunnel
 too; the state is restored on disconnect.
 .
 Built at the x86-64-v1 baseline against glibc 2.39 — Debian 13+,
 Ubuntu 24.04+ and newer Debian-family releases.
